{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "直线 y=2x+1 中的斜率 2 究竟代表什么",
    "goals": [
      "理解斜率表示自变量每增加 1 个单位时因变量的变化量",
      "掌握斜率定义中 Δy 与 Δx 的比值关系，避免颠倒位置"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "先亮出核心结论，再展开几何解释",
        "沿用学生熟悉的山路比喻，通过每水平走 1 步高度上升 2 格直观感知",
        "强调 Δy 比上 Δx 的顺序，针对性纠错"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点A横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "number_02",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点B横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "把点 B 的横坐标调整到 3，观察对应的 y 变化量和斜率",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "向右拖动点 B 的滑块，将数值设为 3",
          "当 x=3 时，y=2×3+1=7，高度从 1 上升到 7，变化量是 6",
          "用高度差 6 除以水平距离 3，依然等于 2"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！跨度是 3，高度上升了 6，6÷3 正好还是 2，斜率完全一致！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_02",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_02",
          "value": 3,
          "tolerance": 0.015
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_02"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过点位移动和山路比喻，直观理解斜率 2 代表横向每走 1 步纵向升高 2 格",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们按你的习惯，先直接说结论：直线 y=2x+1 的斜率 2，意思是 x 每向右增加 1 个单位，y 就向上增加 2 个单位！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线 y=2x+1 中的斜率 2 究竟代表什么",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{2}{1} = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率的核心含义",
                "items": [
                  "结论：x 每增加 1，y 就增加 2",
                  "注意：竖直变化量 Δy 在分子，水平变化量 Δx 在分母"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦斜率计算公式与结论",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们之前用过山路的比喻，现在来看屏幕上的这条直线。把直线想象成一段匀速爬升的山路，我们在上面选两个点：A 点在 x=0，B 点在 x=1。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线 y=2x+1 的斜率观察",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -3,
                    "max": 3,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -10,
                    "max": 10,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(1)",
                    "label": "y=2x+1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "second-point",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 3,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_01))+(1)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_02"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_02))+(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "从 A 点 (0, 1) 出发走到 B 点 (1, 3)：向右水平走了 1 格，高度就直接往上升了 2 格！这里一定要特别注意，我们算斜率时，是高度变化 Δy 放在上面，步长 Δx 放在下面，千万别写反了。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调高度变化比水平步长",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "如果山路继续往前走呢？我们把 B 点向右移动到 x=2 看看。水平方向一共走过了 2 格，而高度从 1 升到了 5，一共升了 4 格！4 除以 2 依然是 2，坡度始终不变。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_02",
              "value": 2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "现在轮到你了，试着把点 B 调到横坐标为 3 的位置，亲自算算高度差除以水平跨度是不是还是 2！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在直线 y=2x+1 中，斜率 2 的核心含义就是变化率：自变量 x 每向右增加 1，因变量 y 就必定向上增加 2。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
